            {
               "text": "<div class=\"atw-game\" data-atw=\"bones\"><p><div class=\"htBoneWrap\"><p class=\"htBonePrompt\" id=\"htBonePrompt\">Some os dois números: conte os dedos levantados juntos e coloque no osso o total de marcas:<br /><center><span id=\"atwaBoneEquation\" class=\"atw-target\"></span></center></p><table class=\"htBoneTable\"><thead><tr><th>Dedos levantados</th><th>O osso</th><th>Setas</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"htBoneHandsCell\"><div class=\"htBoneHands\" id=\"htBoneHands\"></div></td><td class=\"htBoneBoneCell\"><div class=\"htBone\" id=\"htBone\"><div class=\"htBoneFill\"><span id=\"htBoneMarks\"></span></div></div></td><td class=\"htBoneArrowCell\"><div class=\"htBoneArrows\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"fa-solid fa-caret-up htBoneArrow htBoneArrowUp\" id=\"htBoneAdd\" aria-label=\"Adicionar um\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"fa-solid fa-caret-down htBoneArrow htBoneArrowDown\" id=\"htBoneRemove\" aria-label=\"Remover um\"></button></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"htBoneNewNumber\" class=\"reset-tutor-btn\">Nova prática</button> </p><p id=\"htBoneCongrats\" class=\"htBoneCongrats\" style=\"display: none;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-medal\" style=\"color: gold;\"></i> Parabéns! As marcas no osso coincidem com a soma! <i class=\"fa-solid fa-medal\" style=\"color: gold;\"></i></p><p class=\"desc\">As setas ao lado do osso adicionam ou removem marcas.</p><span id=\"atwaBoneHandAltTpl\" class=\"text-store\">Mão com {n} dedos levantados</span></div></p></div>",
